%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1897ac05bccb8e64180e49aee40d0c29, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrationLibrary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarrationLibrary
  modelId: eleven_v4
  narratorVoiceId: qUwKKsEYPewoILlxCIx6
  sturdzaVoiceId: wsy3f26m7s6wq8zKCtJK
  recordings:
  - role: 1
    language: 0
    text: "Welcome to the Academia Mih\u0103ilean\u0103! It is the year 1835, and
      today our academy opens its doors here, in the houses of Petrache Cazimir,
      next to the T\u0103lp\u0103lari Church. One day the academy will grow across
      the street, and an arch of carved stone will join its two houses. The four
      pieces of that arch are hidden in the places of our story, all over Ia\u0219i.
      Find them, learn what each place remembers, and help me raise the arch."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: caf0c33288316c142bc82b58cc95237c, type: 3}
  - role: 1
    language: 0
    text: The academy's seals
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 65c01d6818470f54e90579c8cba3edcb, type: 3}
  - role: 1
    language: 0
    text: 'The academy keeps its secrets under wax seals. Answer every question at
      a stop correctly, and a seal appears near you. Your first one appears when
      you go on: look around and collect it.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8bd3bc0a753455440be61e8604e0f250, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The academy's chapel
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9c1eb7d8eb5f8604886898a3faceac79, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The T\u0103lp\u0103lari Church, right next to the Cazimir houses, was
      the academy's chapel. A liturgy was held there for the academy's opening, and
      the students reached it through a passage in the church wall."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c393596fb322e984da09c6dee670707b, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The left column
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 51b7b1e764ebd114092c2b7e191fa23c, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: A prince raised me in 1639 and dressed my walls in stone carved like lace,
      from the ground to the roof. In my courtyard, Moldova's scholars studied long
      before the academy had a home of its own. Where am I?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9d24731155781444bb580c5e91ae9ef4, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Trei Ierarhi Monastery
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f76c318464139e244afcdf63bf285346, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The academy was born at the Trei Ierarhi Monastery. After Mihail Sturdza
      became prince in August 1834, the school authority, with Metropolitan Veniamin
      and Gheorghe Asachi, found that the monastery's buildings were too small for
      a real academy. Even so, the first course of the Faculty of Philosophy opened
      here, on 20 November 1834.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 663e6de02182c1b479179e6472c81b86, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "For its new home, the academy got the houses of the late Petrache Cazimir,
      in the city centre, next to the T\u0103lp\u0103lari Church. They were bought
      in October 1834, and architect Gustav Freiwald was hired to fit them out. On
      16 June 1835 the academy's own building was inaugurated, with classrooms, study
      rooms, dormitories, a dining hall and an infirmary, after European models."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff98ceb5176a8514a83572142f47c620, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Where did the first course of the Faculty of Philosophy open, in November
      1834?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b94cd8c0fa528aa4eb067c351d65f4f3, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: At the Trei Ierarhi Monastery
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 76e1e431f755b1d458b450ae3b10db89, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: In the Cazimir houses
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93c8dd888e228cd4ea7434a68548d101, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: In the Calimachi Palace
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68507e33fd3a1f045ae92456654fe2fd, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The course opened at Trei Ierarhi on 20 November 1834, while the academy's
      new home was being prepared.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d21d3fdab2e22bb4587d178037f9f863, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Whose houses became the academy's first home?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a2e4b23985ccf934d88c1389ffbc0d3d, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Petrache Cazimir's
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 61c22f39bfab8784eaa6ef01ead833a3, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Gheorghe Asachi's
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9c75dd0044ebd68438563bd1c1635bef, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Mihail Sturdza's
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 43271e8d14a8b3a4ea6351e8536a00fa, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The houses of the late Petrache Cazimir, next to the T\u0103lp\u0103lari
      Church, were bought in October 1834."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7500e5517e209c547b5c9106c322e85d, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: In which year was the academy's own building inaugurated?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 10609e25c6d5e4e4d9ea6f008eafbe77, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 1835
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 96f78f1a0cd53504285002fbc1f912c3, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 1845
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: daaea7411c04fff44a3999a9490baf4a, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 1860
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: afe936806218ea641802c0fe770cf56f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: It was inaugurated on 16 June 1835, although some works went on afterwards.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd4074b95247b6046b1dda4028e5b5b4, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The prince's firemen
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb843b140aee5bc4eb8fe99c107c79de, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "In the same busy year, on 15 May 1835, Prince Mihail Sturdza approved
      the first military fire brigade of Ia\u0219i. Its first company of firemen,
      with a captain, two lieutenants and soldiers, marked the start of modern public
      safety services in Moldavia."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee05c5b3715a10146aa6156181ea2c4a, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The right column
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c0e2e8a92d3954f4cb073009699f5e6e, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Just across the street from the academy, a second house joined it in 1837.
      The house is gone, but the school built on its place in the 1890s still counts
      the academy among its ancestors. Where am I?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9c86a9fa1619de469fea01a2e21e407, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "Colegiul Na\u021Bional"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 84bbdd41d0727f044beeaf7657330ac9, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The academy soon outgrew the Cazimir houses. In June 1837 it bought the
      building across the street, the Voinescu houses, which stood where Colegiul
      Na\u021Bional stands today. In 1838 the boarding school, the stores, the kitchen
      and the administration moved there, while the courses, the library and the
      cabinets of physics, mathematics and natural history stayed in the Cazimir
      houses."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4c34752de0d9c5f4084b7f7d573f2016, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "In 1845 and 1846 the rooms were shared out again: the gymnasium classes
      and the faculties moved into the Voinescu houses, and 120 boarding students
      lived in the Cazimir houses. Today's Colegiul Na\u021Bional, built between
      1890 and 1894, sees itself as the descendant of the Vasilian Gymnasium and
      of the Academia Mih\u0103ilean\u0103."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9938eaf91fcd8414ca28e6b34140dda8, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Which houses did the academy buy across the street in 1837?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc142861baabc7b4caa3bda3c6f3b2b5, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The Voinescu houses
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0ce6821493a0df543b80a3861d9641cf, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The Cazimir houses
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 35f21c7819631b648bf7251818cc8195, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The Calimachi houses
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a6f927353d2814499986ab26373d2bd, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The Voinescu houses were bought in June 1837, on the site of today's Colegiul
      Na\u021Bional."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 02eef7bc3a6a870469527f5ea22bf748, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: What moved into the new building in 1838?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9499593ce862fcf47aae3878136e7ba7, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The boarding school, the kitchen and the administration
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ce6bdf59948f1c546b47ee16e8be479b, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The library and the physics cabinet
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5c91918163b2410448060ddcd11d263b, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The boarding school, the stores, the kitchen and the administration moved;
      the courses and the library stayed in the Cazimir houses.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b3e46f498d04a24ea057ff58fb0d8f2, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Which school stands today where the Voinescu houses stood?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38afc1d2e1589eb4886444183535a2bb, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The Gheorghe Asachi Technical University
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e8b3c1dd87e942c46a8b091255f79d02, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The Vasilian Gymnasium
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c7d8fb61b94c755488cef0c727cece98, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "Colegiul Na\u021Bional was built there between 1890 and 1894, and it counts
      the academy among its ancestors."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f912503bcdf9811489d18f27862d8c58, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The street of the arch
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a24898ae250705345a96f51705bbba8c, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The street between the academy's two houses was once called Uli\u021Ba
      Academiei, the Academy's Lane. The arch that crossed it gave it the name it
      still has today: Strada Arcu, the Street of the Arch."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ece3c54888fe442408f6a6160665f477, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The arc
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2228b42b84ea5d544baab8d7ff62ad4e, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Where the city once held its great exhibitions, among the trees on Copou
      hill, a smaller twin of the lost passage has stood since 1936. Find the copy
      of what you are rebuilding. Where am I?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e42f719a4503369429df9d3516f36577, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The arch replica in Parcul Expozi\u021Biei"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3943c5dd083a9b0429d6c0396c56e6e9, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: To join the academy's two buildings across the street, Gheorghe Asachi
      proposed an arch. Its plan and cost estimate were made by the architecture
      professor A. Costinescu, together with the students of the engineering class.
      The foundation stone was laid on 19 October 1841.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab77b8085da568a40afec7befe388e56, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "Built of carved stone, the arch was finished in September 1845. It was
      more than an ornament: it gave the academy a passage over the street between
      its two houses. In 1936 a smaller replica of the arch was built for an exhibition
      here, in Parcul Expozi\u021Biei, and it still stands."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 401a6031c0a03a246a201cb345876fbd, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Who proposed building the arch?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a475ce61c1b7a147a79f9ced2f9401d, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Gheorghe Asachi
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be3c546eb6ffd8841a9ba9a1f286b001, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "Mihail Kog\u0103lniceanu"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 753d1332732ad404d95d7d65079dee22, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Alexandru Ioan Cuza
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7a9ee47e7d4751469099cefedbdcc80, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Gheorghe Asachi proposed the arch to join the academy's two buildings.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 048a009afebfe404bb0fe9d877600847, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Who drew the arch's plan, with the engineering students?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8571ebc17823a2d49b6878a166621265, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Professor A. Costinescu
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb0c6e807bf069f46be13283e9554635, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Architect Gustav Freiwald
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3000cf31b3c5e54bab4026ce463998e, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Architect Louis Blanc
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52680a8d17924384f85c9b33f182d9b7, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The architecture professor A. Costinescu made the plan and the estimate,
      with the engineering class.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 24013cb3934e5e24d8e12659a7b07cf7, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: In which year was the arch finished?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47f150f9d6263d9418ce5660fe487397, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 1890
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c239ffa317b738a488643d021b0104f4, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The arch was finished in September 1845, four years after its foundation
      stone was laid.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 286c14890be268e4f8ec3282d219984f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The missing inscriptions
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 633bd038a27e3f8479168c3a86f78c3c, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 'The arch was officially handed over on 26 October 1847, but it was never
      quite finished: the inscriptions and bas-reliefs drawn in its plan were never
      carved.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b23c0d4d8b93fbf4e80d3d1b5927257c, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The top beam
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 78eef3bbf9da26941b357b457088f9cc, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: On the boulevard that climbs Copou hill stands a palace of learning, opened
      in 1897 where a theatre once burned. Its Hall of Lost Steps remembers every
      student who has walked it. Where am I?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5eb7c1cfbbf631f4b84d2a4aaf750f12, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The UAIC main building
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ffd5e0cfbcdb62149ba5804d3a427e13, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The academy did not vanish: it grew up. In 1860, Prince Alexandru Ioan
      Cuza turned its higher courses into the University of Ia\u0219i, inaugurated
      on 26 October 1860. Its lower classes became the national college across from
      its old home. Today the Alexandru Ioan Cuza University still sees the Academia
      Mih\u0103ilean\u0103 as its direct ancestor."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2fc5381d75401584785e059384b9444f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The university's main building, the University Palace, was built between
      1893 and 1897 to plans by the architect Louis Blanc, on the site of the old
      National Theatre. It was inaugurated in 1897 in the presence of King Carol
      I, and its great Hall of Lost Steps is one of the most famous rooms in Ia\u0219i."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b284d9d1ae15f224da778e5d03c5ca5a, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "In which year did the academy's courses become the University of Ia\u0219i?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c06ff8adaf2cf2a4594b2967f2c9d3fd, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 1897
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1e9c145608851c34b857b67ccb04201a, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The University of Ia\u0219i was inaugurated on 26 October 1860."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cbbddef5093d8154f8662aa9ee6b7bf2, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Which prince turned the academy into a university?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a57898e1f96dce244b697d1a3650b7a5, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Mihail Sturdza
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a24b2bb765d1814b93276c4b8882932, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Vasile Lupu
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aa2775d3696bf4341871e64818480958, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Prince Alexandru Ioan Cuza founded the university in 1860; it has carried
      his name since 1942.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 36748fcbd16279c40839c7afcfe70acc, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Who designed the University Palace, opened in 1897?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1ee656ea7277ce4ea7306f47168703b, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Louis Blanc
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d53d64a90e87445468cb3121650d7a0a, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: A. Costinescu
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e8a9c9356afac374986d0da92253d230, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Gustav Freiwald
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8b5b660560fdaa4ea5b115ca3d117ca, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The architect Louis Blanc drew the plans; the palace was built between
      1893 and 1897.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 686fa9a5dd417434d98dcfebe9e27038, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: A lecture that made history
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b3836445fcc001a4e86118cb52013589, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "On 24 November 1843, at the academy, Mihail Kog\u0103lniceanu gave the
      opening lecture of the first course of national history. It became a milestone
      of Romanian national awareness: \"...my country is every place on Earth where
      Romanian is spoken, and national history is the history of all of Moldavia,
      of Wallachia, and of our brothers in Transylvania.\""
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38e17711dfd19304b8346fb98f6308b2, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Right.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e79864a34ba38c2458c594163bedf5d5, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: Not quite.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 53c34c3663884c64c900d368b7a9c5bf, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 0 of 3 right
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 953ddbb6cc737bb4c844a21537f7dabd, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 1 of 3 right
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9da8bb627bc09de438bdbbfbfbcc71bb, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 2 of 3 right
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7ccd016663858144881fce5db67f9d01, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 3 of 3 right
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c1d8609d99788e64e98ddc9120964605, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 'Every answer was right. When you go on, a seal will appear near you: find
      it to open one of the academy''s secrets.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 799c1fcdf28c64746a1971a403055e13, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: 'The seal of this place stays hidden this time: it only appears when every
      answer is right.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 758eb056b3e29154dab54167aff61bda, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The arch rises again
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cdc7a740e2f35864f8c7e41f8869135b, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: You have found all four pieces. Back where the academy stood, the arch
      can rise again. Watch the years pass.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 67d24c137bcb1344ca0167ae1705acd5, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The arch is finished. Carved stone now joins the academy's two houses above
      the street, and students cross from one building to the other.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8381d0cb0290a74a867441f779dabe8, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: To build the new National High School and to widen the street, the boarding
      house and the arch are torn down. Only the street's name, Arcu, remembers it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c0a908c8c67e9c64191966955b2dd238, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: In July 1963, the academy's main building, with its dome, is demolished
      for public utility. Where it stood, there is now a street and an apartment
      block.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e15dd45144e8f694ab89e3c8419ffeec, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: The academy lives on
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b2a2d15fd5d36854fa64f29ecb7dbf05, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 0
    text: "The academy is gone, but it lives on. Its higher courses became the University
      of Ia\u0219i, its lower classes the Colegiul Na\u021Bional. Every student in
      Ia\u0219i walks in its footsteps. Thank you for rebuilding its story."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9e75d989cf2d1c34bb8fe90764b981e6, type: 3}
  - role: 1
    language: 0
    text: A letter from the prince
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e0ba510bdae4ae4fb806e1ec3815570, type: 3}
  - role: 1
    language: 0
    text: My dear student, you have found every seal and every secret of our academy.
      Few know its story as well as you do now. The stones are gone, but what was
      learned here was never demolished. Carry it further. Your prince, Mihail Sturdza.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c2c28fd50859614faa0480e96f56074, type: 3}
  - role: 1
    language: 1
    text: "Bine ai venit la Academia Mih\u0103ilean\u0103! Suntem \xEEn anul 1835,
      iar ast\u0103zi academia noastr\u0103 \xEE\u0219i deschide por\u021Bile aici,
      \xEEn casele lui Petrache Cazimir, l\xE2ng\u0103 Biserica T\u0103lp\u0103lari.
      \xCEntr-o zi, academia va cre\u0219te peste drum, iar un arc din piatr\u0103
      cioplit\u0103 \xEEi va uni cele dou\u0103 case. Cele patru piese ale acestui
      arc sunt ascunse \xEEn locurile pove\u0219tii noastre, prin tot Ia\u0219ul.
      G\u0103se\u0219te-le, afl\u0103 ce \xEE\u0219i aminte\u0219te fiecare loc \u0219i
      ajut\u0103-m\u0103 s\u0103 \xEEnal\u021B arcul."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 502e37a558dd5744bb682d73d1c8c26a, type: 3}
  - role: 1
    language: 1
    text: Sigiliile academiei
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80e41787fad6cf14f9562700e8f84d98, type: 3}
  - role: 1
    language: 1
    text: "Academia \xEE\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 secretele sub sigilii de cear\u0103.
      R\u0103spunde corect la toate \xEEntreb\u0103rile de la o oprire \u0219i un
      sigiliu va ap\u0103rea l\xE2ng\u0103 tine. Primul apare c\xE2nd mergi mai departe:
      prive\u0219te \xEEn jur \u0219i colecteaz\u0103-l."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac89d840eab7d1e428b88df395cfcf73, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Paraclisul academiei
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c9285811f1985b2498a31c2b69620c82, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Biserica T\u0103lp\u0103lari, chiar l\xE2ng\u0103 casele Cazimir, a fost
      paraclisul academiei. Acolo s-a \u021Binut o slujb\u0103 pentru deschiderea
      academiei, iar elevii ajungeau la ea printr-un pasaj din zidul bisericii."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 09ea2dde7191bc9499a0e0edcbd37b73, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Coloana st\xE2ng\u0103"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 77199f3d873f733418fb47fc06ef8115, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Un domn m-a \xEEn\u0103l\u021Bat \xEEn 1639 \u0219i mi-a \xEEmbr\u0103cat
      zidurile \xEEn piatr\u0103 sculptat\u0103 ca o dantel\u0103, de la p\u0103m\xE2nt
      p\xE2n\u0103 la acoperi\u0219. \xCEn curtea mea au \xEEnv\u0103\u021Bat c\u0103rturarii
      Moldovei cu mult \xEEnainte ca academia s\u0103 aib\u0103 o cas\u0103 a ei.
      Unde sunt?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f2e61f2068b54044941dddedbe0eb28, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "M\u0103n\u0103stirea Trei Ierarhi"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 77a72e61e9ab02d4a8c69e17fd3df960, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Academia s-a n\u0103scut la M\u0103n\u0103stirea Trei Ierarhi. Dup\u0103
      ce Mihail Sturdza a devenit domn, \xEEn august 1834, Epitropia \xCEnv\u0103\u021B\u0103turilor
      Publice, din care f\u0103ceau parte mitropolitul Veniamin \u0219i Gheorghe
      Asachi, a constatat c\u0103 cl\u0103dirile m\u0103n\u0103stirii erau prea mici
      pentru o adev\u0103rat\u0103 academie. Cu toate acestea, primul curs al Facult\u0103\u021Bii
      de Filozofie s-a deschis chiar aici, la 20 noiembrie 1834."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1be1536a03d80fc4bb46d63cb21346d7, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Pentru noua sa cas\u0103, academia a primit casele r\u0103posatului Petrache
      Cazimir, din centrul ora\u0219ului, l\xE2ng\u0103 Biserica T\u0103lp\u0103lari.
      Ele au fost cump\u0103rate \xEEn octombrie 1834, iar arhitectul Gustav Freiwald
      a fost angajat s\u0103 le amenajeze. La 16 iunie 1835 a fost inaugurat localul
      propriu al academiei, cu s\u0103li de clas\u0103, s\u0103li de studiu, dormitoare,
      trapez\u0103rie \u0219i o sal\u0103 a s\u0103n\u0103t\u0103\u021Bii, dup\u0103
      modele europene."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ebcdb8f980fa74a4082fceed0f83235d, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Unde s-a deschis primul curs al Facult\u0103\u021Bii de Filozofie, \xEEn
      noiembrie 1834?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5bc4363ca9d3c7e4c96422f89f2524e2, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "La M\u0103n\u0103stirea Trei Ierarhi"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d0e8bb1892b9ee42a49cf1cf28765a0, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "\xCEn casele Cazimir"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5bf5de931a6a45346a908c68d586aeec, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "\xCEn Palatul Calimachi"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 43590b9ae2f7a6f428e874e916536817, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Cursul s-a deschis la Trei Ierarhi pe 20 noiembrie 1834, \xEEn timp ce
      noua cas\u0103 a academiei era preg\u0103tit\u0103."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9941e380c023f9d4ebca3e3b3825a47e, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Ale cui case au devenit prima cas\u0103 a academiei?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dfff6d38704708c4a929ba0de84a993f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Ale lui Petrache Cazimir
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06a0c5968f90f7148920cb08b294db56, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Ale lui Gheorghe Asachi
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e96eb23e31db7834a93826c9d4006bfe, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Ale lui Mihail Sturdza
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a0f25d3cc4ded34a8d41fc1c3b9d40d, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Casele r\u0103posatului Petrache Cazimir, l\xE2ng\u0103 Biserica T\u0103lp\u0103lari,
      au fost cump\u0103rate \xEEn octombrie 1834."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc3282dc6258bb741b43644d496786e7, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "\xCEn ce an a fost inaugurat localul propriu al academiei?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5197a568b2f480b488f79846504f30f1, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: 1835
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3263b590122f2b24eb42d4a40b5e9af5, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: 1845
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7c3663164dc2984481a6c81d081d972, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: 1860
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 507f2b67ca93e80428f483928fe95b05, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "A fost inaugurat la 16 iunie 1835, de\u0219i unele lucr\u0103ri au continuat
      \u0219i dup\u0103 aceea."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5cc1a15203d4bcb448485c94ae02c7d9, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Pompierii domnului
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d5269a859837ce4aaf514840c7793d2, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "\xCEn acela\u0219i an plin, la 15 mai 1835, domnitorul Mihail Sturdza
      a aprobat \xEEnfiin\u021Barea primei unit\u0103\u021Bi militare de pompieri
      din Ia\u0219i. Prima \u201Eroat\u0103 de pojarnici\u201D, cu un c\u0103pitan,
      doi locotenen\u021Bi \u0219i solda\u021Bi, a marcat \xEEnceputul serviciilor
      publice moderne de siguran\u021B\u0103 \xEEn Moldova."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15c4210276f0d6749a4a392166675f52, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Coloana dreapt\u0103"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80e954bef5a8baa478d103aef74c6431, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Chiar peste drum de academie, o a doua cas\u0103 i s-a al\u0103turat \xEEn
      1837. Casa nu mai exist\u0103, dar \u0219coala ridicat\u0103 \xEEn locul ei
      \xEEn anii 1890 \xEEnc\u0103 num\u0103r\u0103 academia printre str\u0103mo\u0219ii
      s\u0103i. Unde sunt?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ec81c1760f48384d9f00697f24792bd, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Colegiul Na\u021Bional"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3166eea28485b2b48bcfdfe0dbd68230, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Academia a devenit cur\xE2nd prea mare pentru casele Cazimir. \xCEn iunie
      1837 a cump\u0103rat cl\u0103direa de peste drum, casele Voinescu, aflate pe
      locul actualului Colegiu Na\u021Bional. \xCEn 1838, internatul, economatul,
      buc\u0103t\u0103ria \u0219i administra\u021Bia s-au mutat acolo, \xEEn timp
      ce cursurile, biblioteca \u0219i cabinetele de fizic\u0103, matematic\u0103
      \u0219i istorie natural\u0103 au r\u0103mas \xEEn casele Cazimir."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91fb710dcb7ccfa4da1fb241ae40d8c4, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "\xCEn 1845 \u0219i 1846, \xEEnc\u0103perile au fost \xEEmp\u0103r\u021Bite
      din nou: clasele gimnaziale \u0219i facult\u0103\u021Bile s-au mutat \xEEn
      casele Voinescu, iar \xEEn casele Cazimir au fost caza\u021Bi 120 de elevi
      interni. Actualul Colegiu Na\u021Bional, construit \xEEntre 1890 \u0219i 1894,
      se consider\u0103 urma\u0219ul Gimnaziului Vasilian \u0219i al Academiei Mih\u0103ilene."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a7d9f38cb7af6304098578e095edbf77, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Ce case a cump\u0103rat academia peste drum, \xEEn 1837?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3bd39a3032185654494230b54def64aa, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Casele Voinescu
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f51857d08a59c864e834b21278d172db, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Casele Cazimir
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 09b144f93eaa3be4985bdf0f9e0e7020, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Casele Calimachi
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4428b1639d8724c40a27ad0abbb82b0f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Casele Voinescu au fost cump\u0103rate \xEEn iunie 1837, pe locul actualului
      Colegiu Na\u021Bional."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4a8ec34a95e30d4a8d643c61fb9051a, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Ce s-a mutat \xEEn noua cl\u0103dire \xEEn 1838?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3b781426dc78f2446ac1c5296b792b9d, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Internatul, buc\u0103t\u0103ria \u0219i administra\u021Bia"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d85ec36abb6e9c847b5036752361d249, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Biblioteca \u0219i cabinetul de fizic\u0103"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e75846de254f6b641bc89e71d8d029ad, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "S-au mutat internatul, economatul, buc\u0103t\u0103ria \u0219i administra\u021Bia;
      cursurile \u0219i biblioteca au r\u0103mas \xEEn casele Cazimir."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: deeed043934442b45ae15ab1711dbf13, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Ce \u0219coal\u0103 se afl\u0103 ast\u0103zi pe locul caselor Voinescu?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d52e9791dfb8ab843b10b676426c0912, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Universitatea Tehnic\u0103 \u201EGheorghe Asachi\u201D"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4aa13622d10c0444cbe12ea965de2ae5, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Gimnaziul Vasilian
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1b9ac532f3860c846abffd4de9a78bce, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Colegiul Na\u021Bional a fost construit acolo \xEEntre 1890 \u0219i 1894
      \u0219i num\u0103r\u0103 academia printre str\u0103mo\u0219ii s\u0103i."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c8c8be309c6961c45aeeed393425d650, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Strada arcului
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 878e5f51cc3b84f408848922cbbae644, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Strada dintre cele dou\u0103 case ale academiei se numea odinioar\u0103
      Uli\u021Ba Academiei. Arcul care o traversa i-a dat numele pe care \xEEl poart\u0103
      \u0219i ast\u0103zi: Strada Arcu."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6eae46dc81aa41a42bf53c2b4f885eb3, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Bolta
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de788d753f5ca5f4a830e43e0285f02f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Acolo unde ora\u0219ul \xEE\u0219i \u021Binea odinioar\u0103 marile expozi\u021Bii,
      printre copacii de pe dealul Copoului, un geam\u0103n mai mic al pasajului
      pierdut st\u0103 \xEEn picioare din 1936. G\u0103se\u0219te copia a ceea ce
      reconstruie\u0219ti. Unde sunt?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ab56cbcbc17d3f4f959ac15ce7d4b1b, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Replica arcului din Parcul Expozi\u021Biei"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 381a6bed505b98c4b92a402711b4e9cc, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Pentru a lega cele dou\u0103 cl\u0103diri ale academiei, de o parte \u0219i
      de alta a str\u0103zii, Gheorghe Asachi a propus construirea unui arc. Planul
      \u0219i devizul au fost realizate de profesorul de arhitectur\u0103 A. Costinescu,
      \xEEmpreun\u0103 cu elevii clasei de ingineri. Piatra de temelie a fost pus\u0103
      la 19 octombrie 1841."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7de6387a65c5f3240aa45009831933ef, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Construit din piatr\u0103 cioplit\u0103, arcul a fost terminat \xEEn septembrie
      1845. Nu era doar un ornament: \xEEi oferea academiei un pasaj peste strad\u0103,
      \xEEntre cele dou\u0103 case ale sale. \xCEn 1936, aici, \xEEn Parcul Expozi\u021Biei,
      a fost ridicat\u0103 pentru o expozi\u021Bie o replic\u0103 la scar\u0103 redus\u0103
      a arcului, care exist\u0103 \u0219i ast\u0103zi."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 325996019c271ce4d8f9053f629dbd6e, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Cine a propus construirea arcului?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b50577cd510d6e94c84d59b20efc83c0, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Gheorghe Asachi
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d2eacf74058c31478e4e6446ac62a59, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Mihail Kog\u0103lniceanu"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5bff226347547084f9af0e84a9db83e9, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Alexandru Ioan Cuza
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3f1d17114aac5cf41baf38e35d60bbad, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Gheorghe Asachi a propus arcul pentru a lega cele dou\u0103 cl\u0103diri
      ale academiei."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3df7609545661f24d9bb660919c372f8, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Cine a realizat planul arcului, \xEEmpreun\u0103 cu elevii ingineri?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: feec5362219b9454caafeea6ee8b5d87, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Profesorul A. Costinescu
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27ba0b5d8ac68b74d8b7a82b1821c99e, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Arhitectul Gustav Freiwald
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdfa0b1966430eb4197ec37a3004b7bb, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Arhitectul Louis Blanc
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a3f94ea473a74844e811427182ba5f8f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Profesorul de arhitectur\u0103 A. Costinescu a realizat planul \u0219i
      devizul, \xEEmpreun\u0103 cu clasa de ingineri."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ffecb3b25fb5b846bcd02ffc417c725, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "\xCEn ce an a fost terminat arcul?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9784857c152c7294587a92d39c86acc9, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: 1890
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b5e627eb6cec0a343bc08d6e1e17ec10, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Arcul a fost terminat \xEEn septembrie 1845, la patru ani dup\u0103 punerea
      pietrei de temelie."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7cf2bad1cc7a4f478f77fd94c75be71, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Inscrip\u021Biile care lipsesc"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 365eb015a6992234abc47d5c8c2ea9e9, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Arcul a fost recep\u021Bionat oficial la 26 octombrie 1847, dar nu a fost
      niciodat\u0103 terminat pe deplin: inscrip\u021Biile \u0219i basoreliefurile
      prev\u0103zute \xEEn proiect nu au mai fost sculptate."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b4e8e3f74e466749941155b854df10f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Grinda de sus
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e128c95c60144894e95614ea4fc44155, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Pe bulevardul care urc\u0103 spre dealul Copoului se \xEEnal\u021B\u0103
      un palat al \xEEnv\u0103\u021B\u0103turii, deschis \xEEn 1897 acolo unde a
      ars c\xE2ndva un teatru. Sala Pa\u0219ilor Pierdu\u021Bi \xEE\u0219i aminte\u0219te
      de fiecare student care a p\u0103\u0219it prin ea. Unde sunt?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a4b4e1a65a74a944b867f0e6528a4e1, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Cl\u0103direa principal\u0103 a UAIC"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 370ea49f5007e6f40a5c16256ee74818, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Academia nu a disp\u0103rut: a crescut. \xCEn 1860, domnitorul Alexandru
      Ioan Cuza a transformat cursurile ei superioare \xEEn Universitatea din Ia\u0219i,
      inaugurat\u0103 la 26 octombrie 1860. Clasele ei inferioare au devenit colegiul
      na\u021Bional de peste drum de vechea ei cas\u0103. Ast\u0103zi, Universitatea
      \u201EAlexandru Ioan Cuza\u201D consider\u0103 Academia Mih\u0103ilean\u0103
      str\u0103mo\u0219ul s\u0103u direct."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a5569c263417524bbe32c317d05b1c6, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Cl\u0103direa principal\u0103 a universit\u0103\u021Bii, Palatul Universit\u0103\u021Bii,
      a fost construit\u0103 \xEEntre 1893 \u0219i 1897 dup\u0103 planurile arhitectului
      Louis Blanc, pe locul vechiului Teatru Na\u021Bional. A fost inaugurat\u0103
      \xEEn 1897 \xEEn prezen\u021Ba regelui Carol I, iar Sala Pa\u0219ilor Pierdu\u021Bi
      este una dintre cele mai cunoscute \xEEnc\u0103peri din Ia\u0219i."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6130af9b70c75ff439889fb445371bdc, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "\xCEn ce an au devenit cursurile academiei Universitatea din Ia\u0219i?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c2c2efebf9a2f0340b9cae95b8aeb98d, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: 1897
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a25c766a2a5f8d149b41482a58d0a22f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Universitatea din Ia\u0219i a fost inaugurat\u0103 la 26 octombrie 1860."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f27fec28af7e1a047a82591ba751a158, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Ce domnitor a transformat academia \xEEn universitate?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac080c4f6f2b9974a83bfe117f5f32c2, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Mihail Sturdza
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0c5aa31e3eabd1c44a84b8a3a8073af2, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Vasile Lupu
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d4a4665af78ca964f93122311817192c, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Domnitorul Alexandru Ioan Cuza a \xEEnfiin\u021Bat universitatea \xEEn
      1860; aceasta \xEEi poart\u0103 numele din 1942."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 95b3eff9133277f46a03f3b018d3fd11, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Cine a proiectat Palatul Universit\u0103\u021Bii, deschis \xEEn 1897?"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e189fd74eafef1f499a42f6cb173f482, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Louis Blanc
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e14f91e0ee77ceb4ea11fc6620cc9903, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: A. Costinescu
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d90e82ccf496a02469b3d51dacc1ad2b, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Gustav Freiwald
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e163be7f6afe144293caacee6a742b8, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Arhitectul Louis Blanc a realizat planurile; palatul a fost construit
      \xEEntre 1893 \u0219i 1897."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f47b90ea3dd9a5644915a6ce632fd685, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "O prelegere care a f\u0103cut istorie"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 55dd986c854847d41b5a25c5a1328e9c, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "La 24 noiembrie 1843, la academie, Mihail Kog\u0103lniceanu a rostit \u201ECuv\xE2nt
      de deschidere al celui dint\xE2i curs de istorie na\u021Bional\u0103\u201D,
      un moment important \xEEn dezvoltarea con\u0219tiin\u021Bei na\u021Bionale
      rom\xE2ne\u0219ti: \u201E\u2026\u021Bara mea este orice loc de pe P\u0103m\xE2nt
      unde se vorbe\u0219te rom\xE2ne\u0219te, \u0219i istoria na\u021Bional\u0103
      este istoria \xEEntregii Moldove \u0219i \u021A\u0103rii Rom\xE2ne\u0219ti,
      \u0219i cea a fra\u021Bilor din Ardeal.\u201D"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d94684ff848dae94d983db7d78bfba15, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Corect.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8de7d1fda2155ae4dac3baf3cc1874cd, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: Nu chiar.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e966fcdfc41f04c4bbfab8886231ed50, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: 0 din 3 corecte
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 43cb37b82c2da9b44852d176f3e6e8d3, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: 1 din 3 corecte
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0fd1db70a652cf74c9c4a94a47c36be0, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: 2 din 3 corecte
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a5bf9ee3d6256945bd153d8fd1d1a56, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: 3 din 3 corecte
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 952eca8a8a8b17849aba24bf7d9130c4, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Toate r\u0103spunsurile au fost corecte. C\xE2nd mergi mai departe, un
      sigiliu va ap\u0103rea l\xE2ng\u0103 tine: g\u0103se\u0219te-l ca s\u0103 deschizi
      unul dintre secretele academiei."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27b625bda29303144a613ca448df0353, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Sigiliul acestui loc r\u0103m\xE2ne ascuns de data aceasta: apare doar
      c\xE2nd toate r\u0103spunsurile sunt corecte."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4c84668aaeb014a49b4c908257256ccc, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Arcul se \xEEnal\u021B\u0103 din nou"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 856d37c20f084194cba1fc253438523c, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Ai g\u0103sit toate cele patru piese. \xCEnapoi acolo unde a stat academia,
      arcul se poate \xEEn\u0103l\u021Ba din nou. Prive\u0219te cum trec anii."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7af99a8767d3e9d4995b626b51ccee5f, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Arcul este gata. Piatra cioplit\u0103 une\u0219te acum, peste strad\u0103,
      cele dou\u0103 case ale academiei, iar elevii trec dintr-o cl\u0103dire \xEEn
      alta."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 20b986622d2459447a1517256a1a8f40, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Pentru a construi noul Liceu Na\u021Bional \u0219i pentru a l\u0103rgi
      strada, internatul \u0219i arcul sunt demolate. Doar numele str\u0103zii, Arcu,
      \xEE\u0219i mai aminte\u0219te de el."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93cb1d84fd4188a449c5bd8ed477d645, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "\xCEn iulie 1963, cl\u0103direa principal\u0103 a academiei, cu cupola
      sa, este demolat\u0103 din motive de utilitate public\u0103. Acolo unde st\u0103tea
      se afl\u0103 acum o strad\u0103 \u0219i un bloc de locuin\u021Be."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 64cb7369ed81d7b45829f22aa4fc5c83, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Academia tr\u0103ie\u0219te mai departe"
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 700f78c148355064bb1da4570e546e95, type: 3}
  - role: 0
    language: 1
    text: "Academia nu mai exist\u0103, dar tr\u0103ie\u0219te mai departe. Cursurile
      ei superioare au devenit Universitatea din Ia\u0219i, iar clasele inferioare,
      Colegiul Na\u021Bional. Fiecare student din Ia\u0219i p\u0103\u0219e\u0219te
      pe urmele ei. \xCE\u021Bi mul\u021Bumim c\u0103 i-ai reconstruit povestea."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6038225c46b1d38489732343725f6448, type: 3}
  - role: 1
    language: 1
    text: O scrisoare de la domn
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe0ff780a61c74a4c844478156240aaf, type: 3}
  - role: 1
    language: 1
    text: "Dragul meu student, ai g\u0103sit fiecare sigiliu \u0219i fiecare secret
      al academiei noastre. Pu\u021Bini \xEEi cunosc povestea at\xE2t de bine cum
      o cuno\u0219ti tu acum. Pietrele s-au dus, dar ceea ce s-a \xEEnv\u0103\u021Bat
      aici nu a fost demolat niciodat\u0103. Du-l mai departe. Al t\u0103u domn,
      Mihail Sturdza."
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b5cf2f50a3727741b8158da9cc5f606, type: 3}
